quires a one-time geoscape research called &quot;Operative Reconditioning&quot; - research it first. (Or turn off RequirePerkSwapResearch in the same settings to skip the research.)<br>3. Open a soldier's ability-progression screen and right-click one of the blue-highlighted (rolled) perks - a popup opens listing every perk that could have landed in that slot. Left-click the perk you want, and it replaces the learned perk in that slot.<br><br>Note: only already-learned perks can be swapped - locked future slots are view-only. Enjoy!\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"comment_footer_ctn\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div></div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\n\t<div data-panel=\"{&quot;flow-children&quot;:&quot;row&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}\" class=\"commentthread_comment responsive_body_text   \" id=\"comment_563661122262288788\" style=\"\">\n\n\t\t<div class=\"commentthread_comment_content\">\n\t\t\t<div data-panel=\"{&quot;flow-children&quot;:&quot;row&quot;}\" class=\"commentthread_comment_author\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"commentthread_comment_avatar playerAvatar online\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197961265733\" data-miniprofile=\"1000005\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://avatars.fastly.steamstatic.com/avatar.jpg\" srcset=\"https://avatars.fastly.steamstatic.com/avatar.jpg 1x, https://avatars.fastly.steamstatic.com/avatar.jpg 2x\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"author_name_group\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"flex_row\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"hoverunderline commentthread_author_link\" href=\"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197961265733\"  data-miniprofile=\"1000005\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<bdi>user5</bdi></a>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"commentthread_comment_timestamp\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\